00:05:33.299 --> 00:05:35.435
THEY ARE DOING. JOURNALISTS JOB

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:36.703
IS TO REPORT, WRITE OR BROADCAST

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:39.138
STORIES THAT DEAL WITH MATTERS

00:05:39.205 --> 00:05:40.206
