00:05:56.622 --> 00:05:57.090
DEDICATED JOURNALISTS, WE

00:05:57.156 --> 00:05:59.459
COULDN'T HOLD PEOPLE IN POWER

00:05:59.525 --> 00:06:00.493
ACCOUNTABLE BECAUSE WE WOULDN'T

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.428
KNOW WHAT THEY WERE DOING IN A

00:06:02.495 --> 00:06:03.596
