00:06:06.632 --> 00:06:09.268
CAN SPREAD LIKE WILDFIRE. WE

00:06:09.335 --> 00:06:10.503
CANNOT HAVE A TRULY FUNCTIONAL

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:12.105
