00:22:47.365 --> 00:22:47.899
ISLANDER LEGISLATIVE CAUCUS, I

00:22:47.966 --> 00:22:48.500
FIRST WANT TO WISH YOU A HAPPY

00:22:48.567 --> 00:22:49.034
AAPI HERITAGE MONTH. I'M

00:22:49.101 --> 00:22:49.668
PRESENTING TWO RESOLUTIONS, THE

00:22:49.735 --> 00:22:51.803
FIRST OF WHICH IS SR 79, WHICH

00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:55.240
WOULD PROCLAIM MAY 18TH, 2024 AS

00:22:55.307 --> 00:22:56.475
AAPI DAY AGAINST BULLYING AND

00:22:56.541 --> 00:22:59.311
HATE IN HONOR OF ASIAN PACIFIC

00:22:59.377 --> 00:23:01.580
AMERICAN HERITAGE MONTH, AS WELL

00:23:01.646 --> 00:23:02.814
AS THE ACT OF THE MURDER OF

00:23:02.881 --> 00:23:05.016
VINCENT CHIN, MAY 18TH WAS THE

00:23:05.083 --> 00:23:06.818
BIRTH DATE OF VINCENT CHIN, A

00:23:06.885 --> 00:23:08.687
CHINESE AMERICAN WHO WAS

00:23:08.754 --> 00:23:10.555
MURDERED IN 1982 AS A HATE

00:23:10.622 --> 00:23:12.390
CRIME. THIS SENSELESS KILLING IN

00:23:12.457 --> 00:23:13.391
DETROIT, SPARKED BY ANTI-ASIAN

00:23:13.458 --> 00:23:15.761
ANTI JAPANESE ANIMOSITY, SPARKED

00:23:15.827 --> 00:23:18.930
RECOGNITION WITHIN THE ÁP

00:23:18.997 --> 00:23:19.965
COMMUNITIES ACROSS THE COUNTRY

00:23:20.031 --> 00:23:21.933
THAT WE NEED TO DO MORE TO BRING

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:23.602
AWARENESS TO THE BULLYING AND

00:23:23.668 --> 00:23:24.603
HATE OCCURRING. IN ACKNOWLEDGING

00:23:24.669 --> 00:23:26.705
THIS DAY, WE'RE SPEAKING OUT

00:23:26.772 --> 00:23:27.272
AGAINST MICROAGGRESSIONS AND

00:23:27.339 --> 00:23:29.441
HARASSMENT AND HIGHLIGHTING THE

00:23:29.508 --> 00:23:30.542
ALARMING INCREASE IN HATE THAT

00:23:30.609 --> 00:23:32.844
WE'VE SEEN ACROSS THE BOARD,

00:23:32.911 --> 00:23:33.779
INCLUDING AGAINST ASIAN

00:23:33.845 --> 00:23:36.181
AMERICANS IN THE LAST FEW YEARS.

00:23:36.248 --> 00:23:39.251
IN 2022, 81% OF ASIAN AMERICAN

00:23:39.317 --> 00:23:41.853
YOUTH REPORTED BEING BULLIED OR

00:23:41.920 --> 00:23:42.854
VERBALLY HARASSED BETWEEN MARCH

00:23:42.921 --> 00:23:44.990
2020 AND MARCH 20TH, 23. STOP

00:23:45.056 --> 00:23:48.393
AAPI HATE REPORT RECEIVED MORE

00:23:48.460 --> 00:23:49.394
THAN 11,000 SELF-REPORTED

00:23:49.461 --> 00:23:51.797
INCIDENTS OF ANTI-ASIAN HATE.

00:23:51.863 --> 00:23:55.400
CALIFORNIA IS UNFORTUNATE AND

00:23:55.467 --> 00:23:56.468
EMBARRASSINGLY ONE OF THE TOP

00:23:56.535 --> 00:23:58.837
THREE STATES IN THIS REGARD.

00:23:58.904 --> 00:24:01.339
THIS IS UNACCEPTABLE. SR 79

00:24:01.406 --> 00:24:02.340
EXPRESSES OUR CONDEMNATION OF

00:24:02.407 --> 00:24:05.110
HATE AND BULLYING, INCLUDING

00:24:05.177 --> 00:24:06.111
AGAINST ASIAN AMERICANS AND

00:24:06.178 --> 00:24:07.112
PACIFIC ISLANDERS. STATES THAT

00:24:07.179 --> 00:24:09.481
THIS IS NOT ACCEPTABLE AND THAT

00:24:09.548 --> 00:24:10.715
WE NEED TO COMBAT ALL FORMS OF

00:24:10.782 --> 00:24:12.217
DISCRIMINATION. I RESPECTFULLY

00:24:12.284 --> 00:24:14.753
ASK FOR YOUR AYE VOTE. THANK

00:24:14.820 --> 00:24:18.023
YOU, SENATOR MINH. SENATOR WAHAB

00:24:18.089 --> 00:24:19.157
, THANK YOU. I WOULD LIKE TO

00:24:19.224 --> 00:24:22.527
ECHO THE COMMENTS OF MY

00:24:22.594 --> 00:24:25.263
COLLEAGUE HERE. I DO REPRESENT A

00:24:25.330 --> 00:24:28.600
ROUGHLY 55% ASIAN DISTRICT AND I

00:24:28.667 --> 00:24:29.734
HEAR CONSISTENTLY FROM COMMUNITY

00:24:29.801 --> 00:24:31.803
MEMBERS IN MY DISTRICT THAT THEY

00:24:31.870 --> 00:24:35.340
ARE GENUINELY EVEN AFRAID TO

00:24:35.407 --> 00:24:36.441
RIDE ON TRANSIT BECAUSE THEY

00:24:36.508 --> 00:24:39.444
HAVE BEEN FACED WITH A

00:24:39.511 --> 00:24:42.347
SIGNIFICANT UPTICK IN AAPI HATE.

00:24:42.414 --> 00:24:44.282
AND I WANT TO SAY THAT THIS IS

00:24:44.349 --> 00:24:46.084
NOT JUST WITHIN, ONE SPECIFIC

00:24:46.151 --> 00:24:49.354
COMMUNITY OF THE ASIAN,

00:24:49.421 --> 00:24:50.322
CONTINENT. WE ALSO SEE

00:24:50.388 --> 00:24:53.558
SIGNIFICANT HATE NOT ONLY WITH

00:24:53.625 --> 00:24:56.194
OUR EAST ASIAN FRIENDS. WE SEE A

00:24:56.261 --> 00:24:57.229
RISE IN ISLAMOPHOBIA AND

00:24:57.295 --> 00:24:59.798
HINDUPHOBIA AND SIKH PHOBIA AND

00:24:59.865 --> 00:25:03.101
MUCH MORE, WE HAVE CONSISTENTLY

00:25:03.168 --> 00:25:04.202
BEEN SEEING MORE AND MORE

00:25:04.269 --> 00:25:06.371
AGGRESSIVE ATTACKS TO THOSE THAT

00:25:06.438 --> 00:25:07.439
ARE VISIBLY DIFFERENT. AND THAT

00:25:07.505 --> 00:25:10.508
IS A CONCERN, ESPECIALLY IN THIS

00:25:10.575 --> 00:25:13.245
GREAT STATE OF CALIFORNIA, WHEN

00:25:13.311 --> 00:25:14.312
PEOPLE ARE WEARING EITHER A

00:25:14.379 --> 00:25:16.748
HEADDRESS OR THEY LOOK DIFFERENT

00:25:16.815 --> 00:25:18.516
OR THEY HAVE A DIFFERENT SKIN

00:25:18.583 --> 00:25:20.719
COLOR AND MUCH MORE. THE FACT

00:25:20.785 --> 00:25:22.520
THAT WE ARE IN 2024 AND STILL

00:25:22.587 --> 00:25:24.756
TALKING ABOUT HATE TO ANY

00:25:24.823 --> 00:25:25.724
COMMUNITY IN CALIFORNIA IS

00:25:25.790 --> 00:25:28.593
DISGUSTING. IT NEEDS TO STOP THE

00:25:28.660 --> 00:25:31.663
STEREOTYPES, THE WHISPERS, THE

00:25:31.730 --> 00:25:32.731
SUBLIMINAL CAMPAIGNS, AND SO, SO

00:25:32.797 --> 00:25:36.001
MUCH MORE THAT WE SEE ACROSS

00:25:36.067 --> 00:25:38.303
THIS STATE, BOTH POLITICALLY AS

00:25:38.370 --> 00:25:39.571
WELL AS IN OUR NORMAL EVERYDAY

00:25:39.638 --> 00:25:42.908
CONVERSATIONS NEEDS TO STOP. SO

00:25:42.974 --> 00:25:44.042
I RESPECTFULLY ASK FOR AN AYE

00:25:44.109 --> 00:25:45.710
VOTE. THANK YOU. THANK YOU,

00:25:45.777 --> 00:25:46.711
SENATOR WAHAB. ANY FURTHER

00:25:46.778 --> 00:25:48.780
DISCUSSION ON THIS MEASURE, ANY

00:25:48.847 --> 00:25:49.748
