00:43:02.746 --> 00:43:04.715
MEMORY REQUESTS. ASK ALL THE

00:43:04.782 --> 00:43:06.483
MEMBERS TO RETURN TO THEIR

00:43:06.550 --> 00:43:08.085
CHAIRS. PLEASE WE'RE GOING TO

00:43:08.152 --> 00:43:09.787
BEGIN FIRST WITH SENATOR ASHBY.

00:43:09.853 --> 00:43:10.921
SENATOR ASHBY, THE FLOOR IS

00:43:10.988 --> 00:43:14.325
YOURS. THANK YOU, MR. PRESIDENT.

00:43:14.391 --> 00:43:16.927
I RISE TODAY TO ASK THAT THE

00:43:16.994 --> 00:43:19.964
CALIFORNIA STATE SENATE ADJOURN

00:43:20.030 --> 00:43:21.198
IN THE MEMORY OF THOMAS SAMUEL

00:43:21.265 --> 00:43:24.301
AUGUSTA, WHO PASSED AWAY ON

00:43:24.368 --> 00:43:26.003
JANUARY 6TH, 2024. THOMAS

00:43:26.070 --> 00:43:30.240
AUGUSTA IS THE FATHER OF OUR

00:43:30.307 --> 00:43:32.977
SENATE STAFFER, FRANKIE AUGUSTA,

00:43:33.043 --> 00:43:36.480
WHO SERVES US HERE IN THE SENATE

00:43:36.547 --> 00:43:37.648
CHAMBERS AS PART OF OUR TECH

00:43:37.715 --> 00:43:40.084
SUPPORT TEAM. TOMMY WAS A

00:43:40.150 --> 00:43:41.385
BELOVED AND LIFELONG RESIDENT OF

00:43:41.452 --> 00:43:44.421
SACRAMENTO AND WAS BORN IN

00:43:44.488 --> 00:43:46.523
SACRAMENTO ON AUGUST 10TH, 1933.

00:43:46.590 --> 00:43:50.294
THOMAS ATTENDED SACRAMENTO HIGH

00:43:50.361 --> 00:43:52.029
SCHOOL AND WAS A FOOTBALL STAR

00:43:52.096 --> 00:43:54.231
AS WELL AS BASKETBALL AND

00:43:54.298 --> 00:43:56.600
BASEBALL. HE ATTENDED JUNIOR

00:43:56.667 --> 00:43:59.003
COLLEGE HERE IN SACRAMENTO AND

00:43:59.069 --> 00:44:00.004
ENJOYED SEVEN YEARS OF

00:44:00.070 --> 00:44:00.537
PROFESSIONAL MINOR LEAGUE

00:44:00.604 --> 00:44:02.806
BASEBALL CAREER. HE PLAYED

00:44:02.873 --> 00:44:07.644
OUTFIELD FOR 83 GAMES FOR THE

00:44:07.711 --> 00:44:08.779
1954 BROOK ARMY MEDICAL CENTER

00:44:08.846 --> 00:44:11.281
COMETS AT FORT SAM HOUSTON IN

00:44:11.348 --> 00:44:14.351
TEXAS. HE WAS SIGNED BY THE

00:44:14.418 --> 00:44:15.285
SACRAMENTO SOLONS, A

00:44:15.352 --> 00:44:16.387
PROFESSIONAL TEAM THAT WAS HERE

00:44:16.453 --> 00:44:18.455
IN SACRAMENTO FOR A WHILE IN

00:44:18.522 --> 00:44:21.692
1953, AND WAS LATER DRAFTED INTO

00:44:21.759 --> 00:44:22.860
THE UNITED STATES ARMY, WHERE HE

00:44:22.926 --> 00:44:24.795
SERVED HONORABLY. AFTER HIS TIME

00:44:24.862 --> 00:44:27.631
IN THE SERVICE, HE RETURNED HOME

00:44:27.698 --> 00:44:28.732
TO SACRAMENTO AND PLAYED SIX

00:44:28.799 --> 00:44:31.135
MORE YEARS OF PROFESSIONAL

00:44:31.201 --> 00:44:32.202
BASEBALL. HE IS MEMORIALIZED AT

00:44:32.269 --> 00:44:34.571
THE RIVER CAT STADIUM IN WEST

00:44:34.638 --> 00:44:37.641
SACRAMENTO ON A PLAQUE AND IN A

00:44:37.708 --> 00:44:39.543
MURAL WITH MANY OF THE PREVIOUS

00:44:39.610 --> 00:44:41.512
PLAYERS. IN 1964, HE JOINED THE

00:44:41.578 --> 00:44:43.881
SACRAMENTO CITY FIRE DEPARTMENT,

00:44:43.947 --> 00:44:44.848
WHERE HE ENJOYED A 28 YEAR

00:44:44.915 --> 00:44:47.985
CAREER AS AN ENGINEER, HE ALWAYS

00:44:48.052 --> 00:44:51.755
RESPECTED THE JOB AND HIS FELLOW

00:44:51.822 --> 00:44:54.024
FIREFIGHTERS. WHEN COLLEAGUES

00:44:54.091 --> 00:44:55.192
WERE SERIOUSLY HURT OR DISABLED

00:44:55.259 --> 00:44:57.761
IN THE LINE OF DUTY, HE MADE IT

00:44:57.828 --> 00:44:59.730
A PRIORITY TO GO SPEND TIME WITH

00:44:59.797 --> 00:45:01.932
THEM AND REMIND THEM THAT THEY

00:45:01.999 --> 00:45:03.200
WERE PART OF THE FAMILY. THOMAS

00:45:03.267 --> 00:45:05.369
MET HIS WIFE WHEN HE WAS JUST 12

00:45:05.436 --> 00:45:07.604
YEARS OLD, WALKING TO THE

00:45:07.671 --> 00:45:08.672
NEIGHBORHOOD MARKET. THEY BECAME

00:45:08.739 --> 00:45:11.175
HIGH SCHOOL SWEETHEARTS AND WERE

00:45:11.241 --> 00:45:14.745
MARRIED IN 1956. WENT ON TO

00:45:14.812 --> 00:45:16.680
RAISE THEIR FAMILY, INCLUDING

00:45:16.747 --> 00:45:20.184
OUR FRIEND HERE IN SACRAMENTO ON

00:45:20.250 --> 00:45:21.285
BEHALF OF THE CALIFORNIA STATE

00:45:21.351 --> 00:45:23.720
SENATE, I OFFER MY CONDOLENCES

00:45:23.787 --> 00:45:24.822
TO THOMAS'S ENTIRE FAMILY. HE IS

00:45:24.888 --> 00:45:27.091
SURVIVED BY HIS WIFE OF 67

00:45:27.157 --> 00:45:30.627
YEARS, JOYCE AUGUSTA. HIS SON

00:45:30.694 --> 00:45:31.562
FRANKIE, DAUGHTER ELIZABETH,

00:45:31.628 --> 00:45:34.231
DAUGHTER IN LAW, SALLY, AND

00:45:34.298 --> 00:45:35.199
GRANDCHILDREN CAITLIN, NICK AND

00:45:35.265 --> 00:45:38.969
JAKE. FRANKIE. ON BEHALF OF THE

00:45:39.036 --> 00:45:40.070
CALIFORNIA STATE SENATE, WE WILL

00:45:40.137 --> 00:45:41.939
ADJOURN TODAY IN THE NAME OF

00:45:42.005 --> 00:45:43.073
YOUR FATHER. THANK YOU, SENATOR

00:45:43.140 --> 00:45:44.575
ASHBY. THE SENATE EXTENDS ITS

00:45:44.641 --> 00:45:46.677
CONDOLENCES TO YOUR FAMILY. ALL

00:45:46.743 --> 00:45:50.347
THE FRIENDS OF MR. AUGUSTA,

00:45:50.414 --> 00:45:51.482
PLEASE BRING HIS NAME FORWARD,

00:45:51.548 --> 00:45:54.418
SENATOR ASHBY, SO HE CAN BE

00:45:54.485 --> 00:45:55.419
PROPERLY MEMORIALIZED IN THE

00:45:55.486 --> 00:45:56.487
SENATE JOURNAL. AND WE MAY

00:45:56.553 --> 00:45:58.322
ADJOURN IN HIS MEMORY. NEXT UP,

00:45:58.388 --> 00:46:02.826
SENATOR CABALLERO. THANK YOU,

00:46:02.893 --> 00:46:05.863
MR. PRESIDENT. I RISE TO REQUEST

00:46:05.929 --> 00:46:07.131
THAT WE ADJOURN IN THE MEMORY OF

00:46:07.197 --> 00:46:09.066
DAVID SERRANO, WHO PASSED AWAY

00:46:09.133 --> 00:46:11.401
ON THE EVENING OF FEBRUARY 25TH,

00:46:11.468 --> 00:46:14.771
2020. FOR THE COMMUNITY OF LA

00:46:14.838 --> 00:46:15.973
GRANDE IN MERCED COUNTY AND

00:46:16.039 --> 00:46:18.709
OTHERS IN THE CENTRAL VALLEY, WE

00:46:18.775 --> 00:46:19.910
MOURN THE LOSS OF A COMMUNITY

00:46:19.977 --> 00:46:21.812
LEADER AND DEVOTED FATHER. DAVID

00:46:21.879 --> 00:46:24.982
SERRANO WAS BORN ON AUGUST 13TH,

00:46:25.048 --> 00:46:28.652
1941, TO FLORENCIO AND ANITA

00:46:28.719 --> 00:46:29.853
SERRANO IN COALINGA, CALIFORNIA,

00:46:29.920 --> 00:46:31.922
ALONGSIDE HIS TWIN BROTHER

00:46:31.989 --> 00:46:33.624
DANIEL, WHO WHO LIVED ONLY A

00:46:33.690 --> 00:46:35.993
SHORT TIME. DAVE, AS HIS FAMILY

00:46:36.059 --> 00:46:38.762
AND FRIENDS CALLED HIM, RECEIVED

00:46:38.829 --> 00:46:39.696
HIS EARLY EDUCATION FROM

00:46:39.763 --> 00:46:42.633
PLAINSBURG ELEMENTARY AND OTHER

00:46:42.699 --> 00:46:43.567
CHOWCHILLA GRAMMAR SCHOOLS.

00:46:43.634 --> 00:46:46.770
GROWING UP, HE WAS CONSTANTLY

00:46:46.837 --> 00:46:49.273
BUSY IN MOTION, VERY CREATIVE,

00:46:49.339 --> 00:46:50.140
AND FOREVER INTERESTED IN

00:46:50.207 --> 00:46:51.275
BUILDING THINGS WITH METAL AND

00:46:51.341 --> 00:46:52.910
WOOD. FOLLOWING HIS GRADUATION

00:46:52.976 --> 00:46:55.879
FROM CHOWCHILLA HIGH SCHOOL IN

00:46:55.946 --> 00:46:56.980
1959, DAVE SERRANO ATTENDED

00:46:57.047 --> 00:46:59.716
FRESNO STATE UNIVERSITY, WHERE

00:46:59.783 --> 00:47:01.385
HE GRADUATED WITH A BACHELOR OF

00:47:01.451 --> 00:47:04.021
SCIENCE IN AGRONOMY. IN HIS

00:47:04.087 --> 00:47:06.256
YEARS AT FRESNO STATE, DAVID

00:47:06.323 --> 00:47:07.391
SERRANO, WITH THE HELP OF HIS

00:47:07.457 --> 00:47:08.425
FRIENDS, CREATED THEIR OWN

00:47:08.492 --> 00:47:09.626
CAMERA CLUB AND HE TOOK

00:47:09.693 --> 00:47:10.694
PHOTOGRAPHS FOR THE SCHOOL

00:47:10.761 --> 00:47:12.930
YEARBOOK. HE ALSO FOUND TIME TO

00:47:12.996 --> 00:47:14.831
BUILD ANIMAL PENS AT THE FRESNO

00:47:14.898 --> 00:47:16.533
STATE DAIRY UNTIL MOST NOTABLY

00:47:16.600 --> 00:47:20.671
DURING THIS TIME HE WAS ACTIVELY

00:47:20.737 --> 00:47:21.738
INVOLVED WITH THE NEWMAN CENTER

00:47:21.805 --> 00:47:24.508
AT FRESNO STATE, WHERE HE MET

00:47:24.575 --> 00:47:26.410
ROSEANNE BURKHART, THE LOVE OF

00:47:26.476 --> 00:47:28.345
HIS LIFE, WHO HE MARRIED ON MAY

00:47:28.412 --> 00:47:32.149
13TH, 1967, AT THE NEWMAN CENTER

00:47:32.216 --> 00:47:33.150
. DAVID SERRANO AND ROSEANNE

00:47:33.217 --> 00:47:35.586
BURKHART WERE MARRIED FOR 50

00:47:35.652 --> 00:47:36.753
YEARS AND BROUGHT FOUR CHILDREN

00:47:36.820 --> 00:47:38.088
INTO THE WORLD. ROSEANNE AND

00:47:38.155 --> 00:47:41.625
DAVID SERRANO WORKED ALONGSIDE

00:47:41.692 --> 00:47:42.726
THE SERRANO IN-LAWS, AND WHEN

00:47:42.793 --> 00:47:43.927
THE FARM WAS PASSED DOWN, THEY

00:47:43.994 --> 00:47:45.696
TOOK MUCH PRIDE IN GROWING

00:47:45.762 --> 00:47:48.198
ALMONDS, CORN, WHEAT, SORGHUM,

00:47:48.265 --> 00:47:49.266
APRICOTS, AND COTTON. THEY ALSO

00:47:49.333 --> 00:47:51.902
RAISED A SMALL HERD OF SHEEP TO

00:47:51.969 --> 00:47:53.070
KEEP DAVID DAVE SERRANO'S

00:47:53.136 --> 00:47:55.105
GRANDFATHER'S LEGACY ALIVE. HE

00:47:55.172 --> 00:47:56.173
LOVED FARMING AND WATCHING

00:47:56.240 --> 00:47:59.042
PLANTS GROW. IT BROUGHT HIM JOY

00:47:59.109 --> 00:48:01.745
TO SEE THE CIRCLE OF LIFE, EVEN

00:48:01.812 --> 00:48:02.846
WHEN FARMING WAS HARD WORK.

00:48:02.913 --> 00:48:05.382
DAVID SERRANO WAS DEDICATED TO

00:48:05.449 --> 00:48:06.583
FAITH, FAMILY AND COMMUNITY, AND

00:48:06.650 --> 00:48:08.919
SERVED AS A LECTOR, EUCHARISTIC

00:48:08.986 --> 00:48:11.922
EUCHARISTIC MINISTER, AND TOOK

00:48:11.989 --> 00:48:13.090
UP COLLECTION ON SATURDAY NIGHT

00:48:13.156 --> 00:48:15.158
MASS AT OUR LADY OF LOURDES

00:48:15.225 --> 00:48:16.360
CATHOLIC CHURCH IN LA GRANDE. HE

00:48:16.426 --> 00:48:18.695
SERVED ON THE PLAINSBURG

00:48:18.762 --> 00:48:19.730
ELEMENTARY SCHOOL BOARD AND THE

00:48:19.796 --> 00:48:22.432
LA GRANDE UNION HIGH SCHOOL

00:48:22.499 --> 00:48:23.600
BOARD, AND SERVED AS PRESIDENT

00:48:23.667 --> 00:48:25.702
OF THE MERCED COUNTY FARM

00:48:25.769 --> 00:48:26.870
BUREAU, AND WAS A LONG STANDING

00:48:26.937 --> 00:48:29.373
MEMBER OF THE LA GRANDE ANTHONY

00:48:29.439 --> 00:48:30.407
WATER DISTRICT AND NUMEROUS

00:48:30.474 --> 00:48:32.743
OTHER AGRICULTURAL AND COMMUNITY

00:48:32.809 --> 00:48:33.644
ORGANIZATIONS. THIS IS THE

00:48:33.710 --> 00:48:35.879
LIFEBLOOD OF RURAL CALIFORNIA.

00:48:35.946 --> 00:48:36.913
DAVE SERRANO WAS PROUD OF HIS

00:48:36.980 --> 00:48:39.816
BASQUE HERITAGE AND EMBODIED THE

00:48:39.883 --> 00:48:42.619
BASQUE PROVERB SUCCESS IS THE

00:48:42.686 --> 00:48:44.655
RESULT OF A LOT OF HARD WORK. BY

00:48:44.721 --> 00:48:46.723
EARNING ACCOLADES SUCH AS THE

00:48:46.790 --> 00:48:47.724
STATE OF CALIFORNIA GOVERNOR'S

00:48:47.791 --> 00:48:49.593
SMALL BUSINESS PERSON OF THE

00:48:49.660 --> 00:48:50.794
YEAR, MERCED COUNTY OUTSTANDING

00:48:50.861 --> 00:48:53.563
TREE AND VINES AWARD IN THE LA

00:48:53.630 --> 00:48:54.631
GRANDE COMMUNITY DAY CITIZEN OF

00:48:54.698 --> 00:48:56.967
THE YEAR. DAVID SERRANO WAS WELL

00:48:57.034 --> 00:48:59.469
LOVED AND RESPECTED IN HIS

00:48:59.536 --> 00:49:01.571
COMMUNITY. HE IS SURVIVED BY HIS

00:49:01.638 --> 00:49:02.639
FOUR CHILDREN CHRISTINE SERRANO,

00:49:02.706 --> 00:49:04.908
DANIELLE SERRANO, MATTHEW

00:49:04.975 --> 00:49:05.976
SERRANO AND MICHAEL SERRANO, AND

00:49:06.043 --> 00:49:07.544
HIS FIVE GRANDCHILDREN,

00:49:07.611 --> 00:49:11.048
ISABELLA, WILLIAM, CATALINA,

00:49:11.114 --> 00:49:12.082
MADISON AND A BABY GIRL.

00:49:12.149 --> 00:49:14.651
ARRIVING IN MAY, DAVID SERRANO

00:49:14.718 --> 00:49:15.719
WAS DEEPLY LOVED AND WILL BE

00:49:15.786 --> 00:49:17.754
MISSED. HE WILL BE REMEMBERED AS

00:49:17.821 --> 00:49:18.989
A GENTLEMAN IN HIS COMMUNITY AND

00:49:19.056 --> 00:49:21.325
HIS FAMILY, SAYS HE WAS A

00:49:21.391 --> 00:49:23.226
GOOFBALL AT HOME. I OFFER MY

00:49:23.293 --> 00:49:25.062
DEEPEST CONDOLENCES TO DAVID

00:49:25.128 --> 00:49:26.063
SERRANO'S FAMILY, FRIENDS,

00:49:26.129 --> 00:49:28.665
COLLEAGUES AND COMMUNITY. MAY HE

00:49:28.732 --> 00:49:30.534
HAVE THE SPECIAL PLACE IN HEAVEN

00:49:30.600 --> 00:49:32.402
RESERVED FOR THOSE WHO

00:49:32.469 --> 00:49:33.570
CONTRIBUTE TO THE COMMUNITY, AND

00:49:33.637 --> 00:49:35.739
MAY HE REST IN ETERNAL PEACE.

00:49:35.806 --> 00:49:36.873
THANK YOU MEMBERS, AND I ASK

00:49:36.940 --> 00:49:38.809
THAT WE ADJOURN THE SENATE TODAY

00:49:38.875 --> 00:49:39.476
IN HIS MEMORY. THANK YOU,

00:49:39.543 --> 00:49:42.979
SENATOR CABALLERO. THE SENATE

00:49:43.046 --> 00:49:43.980
EXTENDS ITS CONDOLENCES TO

00:49:44.047 --> 00:49:45.048
FAMILY AND FRIENDS OF MR.

00:49:45.115 --> 00:49:47.484
SERRANO. PLEASE BRING HIS NAME

00:49:47.551 --> 00:49:48.719
FORWARD SO WE CAN BE PROPERLY,

00:49:48.785 --> 00:49:49.986
PROPERLY MEMORIALIZED IN THE

00:49:50.053 --> 00:49:51.021
SENATE JOURNAL, AS WE HAD

00:49:51.088 --> 00:49:53.056
ADJOURNED IN HIS MEMORY. NEXT

00:49:53.123 --> 00:49:54.224
UP, WE WANT TO ASK SENATOR

00:49:54.291 --> 00:49:57.527
UMBERG TO HAVE THE FLOOR. THANK

00:49:57.594 --> 00:49:58.495
YOU, MR. PRESIDENT. AND

00:49:58.562 --> 00:50:01.331
COLLEAGUES, I RISE TO HONOR THE

00:50:01.398 --> 00:50:02.566
LIFE AND THE MEMORY OF VICKIE.

00:50:02.632 --> 00:50:04.901
SAMMY VENTO. VICKIE WAS A

00:50:04.968 --> 00:50:05.902
COMPASSIONATE CIVIL RIGHTS AND

00:50:05.969 --> 00:50:08.438
PERSONAL INJURY LAWYER FOR 36

00:50:08.505 --> 00:50:10.941
YEARS. SHE PASSED AWAY MUCH,

00:50:11.007 --> 00:50:12.109
MUCH TOO EARLY IN FEBRUARY OF

00:50:12.175 --> 00:50:14.378
THIS YEAR. SHE WAS BORN ON

00:50:14.444 --> 00:50:16.179
OCTOBER 27TH, 1958, TO HER

00:50:16.246 --> 00:50:18.448
PARENTS, VICENTE AND IRMA, IN

00:50:18.515 --> 00:50:21.785
BOLIVIA. VICKIE ARRIVED IN THE

00:50:21.852 --> 00:50:22.953
UNITED STATES WHEN SHE WAS SIX.

00:50:23.019 --> 00:50:24.888
GROWING UP ON EASTWOOD AVENUE IN

00:50:24.955 --> 00:50:25.956
SANTA ANA, CALIFORNIA, WITH HER

00:50:26.022 --> 00:50:28.625
BROTHER AND SISTER VINCE AND

00:50:28.692 --> 00:50:31.862
DAISY, VICKIE WENT TO SCHOOL IN

00:50:31.928 --> 00:50:32.963
SANTA ANA, ATTENDING JOHN MUIR

00:50:33.029 --> 00:50:34.364
ELEMENTARY. LATHROP

00:50:34.431 --> 00:50:35.465
INTERMEDIATE, AND SANTA ANA HIGH

00:50:35.532 --> 00:50:36.666
SCHOOL. SHE WAS TRULY A DAUGHTER

00:50:36.733 --> 00:50:38.802
OF SANTA ANA. WHEN VICKIE TURNED

00:50:38.869 --> 00:50:40.937
15, SHE STARTED WORKING AT THE

00:50:41.004 --> 00:50:42.172
LAW OFFICES OF MILTON C GRIMES,

00:50:42.239 --> 00:50:45.108
WHERE SHE FOUND A LOVE OF THE

00:50:45.175 --> 00:50:47.310
LAW AND MENTORS MILTON AND

00:50:47.377 --> 00:50:48.311
ELOISE GRIMES. AFTER VICKIE

00:50:48.378 --> 00:50:50.747
GRADUATED FROM SANTA ANA HIGH,

00:50:50.814 --> 00:50:51.882
SHE ATTENDED UC IRVINE, WHERE

00:50:51.948 --> 00:50:54.184
SHE RECEIVED A BACHELOR IN

00:50:54.251 --> 00:50:55.318
SCIENCE IN SOCIAL SCIENCE AND

00:50:55.385 --> 00:50:57.287
BACHELOR OF ARTS IN SPANISH

00:50:57.354 --> 00:50:57.821
LITERATURE. FOLLOWING HER

00:50:57.888 --> 00:51:01.091
GRADUATION FROM UCI, SHE

00:51:01.158 --> 00:51:02.159
ATTENDED UC COLLEGE OF LAW IN

00:51:02.225 --> 00:51:04.428
SAN FRANCISCO, WHERE SHE EARNED

00:51:04.494 --> 00:51:05.529
HER JURIS DOCTOR. IN. HER WORK

00:51:05.595 --> 00:51:08.031
IN CIVIL RIGHTS, STARTED EARLY

00:51:08.098 --> 00:51:09.099
WHILE ATTENDING UCI, SHE WAS A

00:51:09.166 --> 00:51:11.134
FOUNDING MEMBER OF MUJERES

00:51:11.201 --> 00:51:12.202
LATINAS, WHERE SHE ORGANIZED FOR

00:51:12.269 --> 00:51:14.371
THE RIGHTS OF MINORITIES AND

00:51:14.438 --> 00:51:15.539
WOMEN. SIMILARLY, AT UC LAW, SAN

00:51:15.605 --> 00:51:17.741
FRANCISCO, SHE WAS PRESIDENT OF

00:51:17.808 --> 00:51:18.809
THE LA RAZA LAW STUDENTS

00:51:18.875 --> 00:51:21.411
ASSOCIATION, AN ORGANIZATION

00:51:21.478 --> 00:51:24.414
THAT AIMED TO RECRUIT LATINO LAW

00:51:24.481 --> 00:51:25.415
STUDENTS TO PROVIDE COMMUNITY

00:51:25.482 --> 00:51:27.584
SERVICE FOR IMPOVERISHED

00:51:27.651 --> 00:51:29.719
COMMUNITIES IN SAN FRANCISCO. IN

00:51:29.786 --> 00:51:30.921
1988, SHE WAS ADMITTED TO THE

00:51:30.987 --> 00:51:33.490
STATE BAR OF CALIFORNIA, AND SHE

00:51:33.557 --> 00:51:35.358
BEGAN WORK AT THE LA CITY

00:51:35.425 --> 00:51:36.827
ATTORNEY'S OFFICE, A FEW YEARS

00:51:36.893 --> 00:51:38.662
LATER, VICKIE BEGAN HER OWN LAW

00:51:38.728 --> 00:51:39.729
PRACTICE IN PERSONAL INJURY AND

00:51:39.796 --> 00:51:40.897
CIVIL RIGHTS LAW. SHE

00:51:40.964 --> 00:51:43.400
SPECIALIZED IN CASES INVOLVING

00:51:43.467 --> 00:51:44.401
INJURY OR WRONGFUL DEATH,

00:51:44.468 --> 00:51:46.636
PARTICULARLY STEMMING FROM

00:51:46.703 --> 00:51:47.204
POLICE BRUTALITY, EXCESSIVE

00:51:47.270 --> 00:51:50.006
FORCE IN CUSTODY, DEATHS, DENIAL

00:51:50.073 --> 00:51:51.074
OF MEDICAL CARE TO INMATES,

00:51:51.141 --> 00:51:53.176
ASSAULTS AND SEXUAL ABUSE OF

00:51:53.243 --> 00:51:54.177
MINORS AND JUVENILE DETENTION

00:51:54.244 --> 00:51:56.880
FACILITIES, WRONGFUL CONVICTIONS

00:51:56.947 --> 00:51:57.814
AND RACIAL PROFILING. MANY OF

00:51:57.881 --> 00:52:00.250
HER CASES WERE IMPACTFUL FAR

00:52:00.317 --> 00:52:03.253
BEYOND THE INDIVIDUAL PARTIES

00:52:03.320 --> 00:52:04.254
AND IGNITED SYSTEMIC CHANGE.

00:52:04.321 --> 00:52:06.823
VICKIE WAS A COMPASSIONATE,

00:52:06.890 --> 00:52:07.791
EMPATHETIC, DEDICATED WOMAN WHO

00:52:07.858 --> 00:52:11.027
PUT THE LIVES OF OTHERS IN FRONT

00:52:11.094 --> 00:52:13.396
OF HER OWN. COINED AS A QUOTE,

00:52:13.463 --> 00:52:14.464
CIVIL RIGHTS LAWYER EXCUSE ME,

00:52:14.531 --> 00:52:16.733
CIVIL RIGHTS WARRIOR. END QUOTE.

00:52:16.800 --> 00:52:17.667
VICKIE WILL FOREVER BE

00:52:17.734 --> 00:52:18.668
REMEMBERED FOR CHANGING THE

00:52:18.735 --> 00:52:20.837
LIVES OF HER CLIENTS, HER

00:52:20.904 --> 00:52:23.507
FAMILY, AND SO MANY OTHERS.

00:52:23.573 --> 00:52:24.541
VICKIE IS SURVIVED BY HER

00:52:24.608 --> 00:52:27.177
HUSBAND, DALE GALIPO, WHO IS

00:52:27.244 --> 00:52:28.411
ALSO A CIVIL RIGHTS ATTORNEY.

00:52:28.478 --> 00:52:30.146
HER SIBLINGS. ORANGE COUNTY

00:52:30.213 --> 00:52:30.714
SUPERVISOR VINCE SARMIENTO,

00:52:30.780 --> 00:52:34.251
DAISY SARMIENTO, AND MANY

00:52:34.317 --> 00:52:36.019
FRIENDS AND LOVED ONES WHO MOURN

00:52:36.086 --> 00:52:37.754
HER DEATH. COLLEAGUES I ASK THAT

00:52:37.821 --> 00:52:39.623
WE ADJOURN TODAY IN MEMORY OF

00:52:39.689 --> 00:52:41.324
VICKIE SARMIENTO. THANK YOU,

00:52:41.391 --> 00:52:42.325
SENATOR AYZENBERG. THE SENATE

00:52:42.392 --> 00:52:44.794
EXTENDS ITS CONDOLENCE TO THE

00:52:44.861 --> 00:52:45.929
FRIENDS AND FAMILY OF MISS

00:52:45.996 --> 00:52:48.198
SARMIENTO. PLEASE BRING HER NAME

00:52:48.265 --> 00:52:50.100
FORWARD SO SHE CAN BE PROPERLY

00:52:50.166 --> 00:52:51.067
MEMORIALIZED IN THE SENATE

00:52:51.134 --> 00:52:52.335
JOURNAL, AND THAT WE MAY ADJOURN

00:52:52.402 --> 00:52:55.772
IN HER MEMORY IF THERE IS NO

00:52:55.839 --> 00:52:58.408
OTHER BUSINESS BEFORE THE

00:52:58.475 --> 00:53:00.810
SENATE. SENATOR MCGUIRE NØ.

00:53:00.877 --> 00:53:04.314
THERE HE IS, SENATOR MCGUIRE.

00:53:04.381 --> 00:53:09.853
THE DESK IS CLEAR. AS THEY MAKE

00:53:09.920 --> 00:53:11.721
THE LONG TREK, THE NEXT FLOOR

00:53:11.788 --> 00:53:13.290
SESSION IS SCHEDULED FOR MONDAY,

00:53:13.356 --> 00:53:15.125
MAY 6TH AT 2 P.M. HAVE A

00:53:15.191 --> 00:53:16.760
WONDERFUL WEEKEND. THANK YOU SO

00:53:16.826 --> 00:53:18.595
MUCH. THE SENATE WILL BE IN

00:53:18.662 --> 00:53:19.763
RECESS UNTIL 3:30 P.M, AT WHICH

00:53:19.829 --> 00:53:21.631
TIME THE ADJOURNMENT MOTION WILL

00:53:21.698 --> 00:53:22.832
BE MADE. WE WILL RECONVENE

00:53:22.899 --> 00:53:40.216
MONDAY AT 2 P.M.


